Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.22,0:02:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.52,0:02:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice Synthesis 30. Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.64,0:02:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's wearing our school's uniform!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.58,0:02:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard she asked for it specifically.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.22,0:02:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said she wanted to wear\Nthe same uniform as the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.08,0:02:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knights who came to help\Nthe human guard in Arun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.72,0:02:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't her first choice, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She really wanted to wear the same\Ngold armor she had in the Underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.02,0:03:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet rats saw how much it'd cost to make\Ngold-plated armor and were like, nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.96,0:03:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They sure didn't skimp on\Ngetting her looks just right.
