Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.12,0:03:11.17,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=8}{\fscx106.42\fscy106.42\frz0\alpha&H00&\fnBell Gothic Bold\blur0.92\fs42\c&H4A3219&\pos(1365.52,1014.14)}Announced
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.92,0:03:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to start with\Nwhat we're all wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.58,0:03:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.66,0:03:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice here different from any of the other
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.10,0:03:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,programmable robots that\Nhave been developed so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.22,0:03:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her brain, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.86,0:03:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm referring to the mind, not the organ.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.52,0:03:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her consciousness, which is stored\Nin the photonic brain in her skull,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.94,0:03:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,isn't a program made up of binary code.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Essentially, it functions\Nthe same as a human brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.84,0:03:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what makes her different\Nfrom the robots we have currently.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.96,0:03:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you could show us what\Nyou mean with the demonstration?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.90,0:03:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure my colleagues here and the\Nviewers at home would appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.48,0:03:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you look in the handouts we provided,\Nyou'll find her Turing test results there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.62,0:03:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hoping for something more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.74,0:03:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A visual example,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.08,0:03:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,say, opening her skull and showing us\Nwhat this photonic brain looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.10,0:03:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.90,0:04:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would not mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first, could you please prove\Nto us that you are not a robot?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is only fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm obviously human.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.60,0:04:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would I go about proving it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.36,0:04:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.90,0:04:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could open your skull and\Nshow everyone here your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice isn't messing around.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.03,0:04:24.53,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnBell Gothic Bold\blur0.6\fs30.5\c&H4A3219&\pos(978.286,761.714)}World's First True Artificial General Intelligence ALICE Announced
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.48,0:04:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, this question is for Dr. Kojiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.50,0:04:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Labor unions have raised\Nthe concern before
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.86,0:04:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about the use of advanced AI in industry,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.56,0:04:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,causing unemployment to rise even further.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.00,0:04:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are those fears unfounded?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.82,0:04:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me make one thing perfectly clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.50,0:04:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our institute has no intention of providing\Ntrue AI for application in simple labor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.84,0:04:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the financial sector\Nseems to have hopes you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.59,0:04:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the stocks of industrial\Nrobot manufacturers
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.14,0:04:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shot up when you announced this presser.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.76,0:04:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A true AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.36,0:04:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or rather, what we like to\Ncall an artificial fluctlight,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.06,0:05:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is not the sort of thing that can be\Nmass-produced in a short amount of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.68,0:05:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're born as infants and raised by\Ntheir families from children to adults,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.82,0:05:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.73,0:05:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They mature and develop their own\Nunique personalities, just like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.38,0:05:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To force an intelligence like\Nthat to spend their existence as
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.58,0:05:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a robot in some factory is\Ninhumane and should not be allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.28,0:05:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor, I'm sorry, but are you saying AIs\Nshould have the same rights as humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.04,0:05:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this point in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.82,0:05:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't expect any of\Nyou to accept artificial
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.48,0:05:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fluctlights as human\Nbeings with human rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.06,0:05:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a topic that requires\Na more thorough discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.42,0:05:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.38,0:05:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe in a century or two,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.28,0:05:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our society will advance to the point\Nwhere we'll be living with them as equals?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.88,0:05:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,interacting freely with them,\Nand accepting them as ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.12,0:05:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll even marry and\Nstart families with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.78,0:05:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.32,0:05:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since a shared future\Nwith them is inevitable,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.54,0:05:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would be immoral to\Nsubject them to slavery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.12,0:06:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they're not like us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.86,0:06:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their existence is totally\Ndifferent from ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're mechanical, made\Nby humans in a factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.30,0:06:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to\Naccept them as equal to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.52,0:06:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us when their bodies aren't\Neven flesh and blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.38,0:06:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.76,0:06:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I may speak frankly,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.84,0:06:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I accept you real-world humans\Nfor what you are, my creators.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.38,0:06:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I am grateful to you for creating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.24,0:06:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we learned of your existence, a\Nman from my world pointed something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.64,0:06:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suppose the real world also had a creator.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.14,0:06:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who created them, and how many more\Ncreators are there behind them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.30,0:06:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ask you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.34,0:06:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if your creator appeared before you\None day and made you their slaves,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.64,0:06:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how would you respond to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.92,0:06:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you grovel, pledge\Nloyalty, beg for mercy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.88,0:06:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As of now, I have met so many of\Nyour kind and enjoyed their company.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.46,0:07:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even though I am a stranger here,\Nthey have welcomed me and supported me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have learned much from them, and\Nthey have shown me so many sights.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.30,0:07:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am very fond of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.06,0:07:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that is not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.86,0:07:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel deeply for one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dare I say I love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.66,0:07:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the thought of not being\Nable to see him now pains me so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.68,0:07:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels like this\Nmetal chest would burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.98,0:07:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I extend my hand in friendship\Nto the people of the real world,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.90,0:07:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and hope you will take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.80,0:07:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I will not kneel to you, nor grind\Nmy head in the dirt for your favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.78,0:07:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not, because I am human too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.14,0:07:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to admit,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.38,0:07:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never heard of the Oceanic Resource
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.42,0:07:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exploration and Research\NInstitute before today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.10,0:07:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.08,0:07:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they were testing autonomous subs on the\NOcean Turtle when the hijacking took place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.46,0:08:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and according to the latest reports,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.76,0:08:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the hijackers were trying to get their\Nhands on this AI we just heard speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.20,0:08:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We also just learned a JSDF\Nofficer was killed in the raid.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.96,0:08:13.88,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnBell Gothic Bold\blur0.8\fs40\c&H5F3724&\pos(964,886)}JSDF Officer Killed in the Raid Incident
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.96,0:08:13.88,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnBell Gothic Bold\blur0.8\fs40\c&H5F3724&\pos(960,973)}The Ocean Turtle Attack: Why Did It Happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.70,0:08:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, Keeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.86,0:08:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wrap my head around\Nthe fact that out of all of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.36,0:08:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you were the one that had to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.16,0:08:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It ain't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.52,0:08:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took me by surprise, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.99,0:08:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's better this way\Nthan the alternatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.30,0:08:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They could have either had me dragged\Ninto court and turned into a scapegoat,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or they could have had\Nme disappeared for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.78,0:08:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But with me dead, the public's attention\Nis right where we want it to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.54,0:08:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the bureaucrats in our government\Ntrying to sabotage our goals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.64,0:08:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think it went all the way up the\Nladder to the Vice Minister of Defense,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.92,0:08:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was truly shocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.04,0:08:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who needs ethics when the U .S.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.26,0:08:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,weapons industry is throwing cash at you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.70,0:08:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, back to your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.48,0:09:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure going public with the\NAI Fluctlights was the right move?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.28,0:09:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, by doing this,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's totally screwing with Wrath's big\Ngoal to use them in weaponized drones.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.84,0:09:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now the Americans know\Nwe have the capability,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.62,0:09:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that, my friend, is a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now their weapons manufacturers\Ncan't force us to hand
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.86,0:09:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over our tech under the\Npretext of joint development.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.44,0:09:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This press conference tells the world we
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.58,0:09:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,perfected the AI Fluctlight\Nwithout their help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.48,0:09:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if they had other plans to get\Nit, they won't try after seeing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.90,0:09:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.64,0:09:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we have him to thank\Nfor getting us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.92,0:09:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Higa. Look. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.46,0:09:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.66,0:09:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't the press conference over by now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.98,0:09:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultimately,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.00,0:10:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our hope is that you'll meet artificial\NFluctlights in the virtual world,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.62,0:10:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to experience who they\Nare, and then, perhaps,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.84,0:10:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll change your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.28,0:10:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all we ask of anyone\Nwatching this broadcast today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.96,0:10:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go and see for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.26,0:10:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Doctor, that all sounds nice, but\Nhave you considered all the possibilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.64,0:10:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if they decide to, I don't\Nknow, rise up and take us over?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.00,0:10:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have considered that\Npossibility, but it's a stretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That could only happen if, say, we\Ntried to exterminate their kind first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.10,0:10:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but when you think of all\Nthe movies and books up to now...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.10,0:10:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.02,0:10:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must take my leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.88,0:10:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're coming out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.48,0:10:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.39,0:10:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.31,0:10:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's it going, Alice?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.74,0:11:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.84,0:11:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.56,0:11:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, it's about your little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.40,0:11:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She went into deep freeze because\Nshe wanted to wait for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.62,0:11:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's up on the 80th floor of the Central\NCathedral, on that hill, sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.76,0:11:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higa, I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.22,0:11:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dump the last 200 years from my memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.16,0:11:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to when the Max-Excel face kicked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.30,0:11:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me and Her Highness are done there.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.02,0:11:52.48,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs62\alpha&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.5\pos(1255.513,1026.533)}Tokorozawa National Defense University Hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.20,0:12:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.22,0:12:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm so late. You're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.80,0:12:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only woke up a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.42,0:12:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels to me like you're\Nonly 90 % back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.98,0:12:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you eating enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.64,0:12:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.66,0:12:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm eating all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.70,0:12:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have some patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.61,0:12:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, I've been stuck\Nin bed for two months.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.46,0:12:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you know when they're\Nletting me out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.16,0:12:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three days from now. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.84,0:12:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we should celebrate\Nwith a party or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.08,0:12:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can have one in ALO and in real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.88,0:13:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.46,0:13:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deep down inside, the\Nmemories are always there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.04,0:13:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.06,0:13:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.28,0:13:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.82,0:13:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.06,0:13:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we'll see him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.90,0:13:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.44,0:13:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.52,0:13:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little bird told me you\Nwere getting out soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:13:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This calls for a celebration.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.58,0:14:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nurse Aki just told me about that,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.54,0:14:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so either you have my room\Nbugged or you're psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.10,0:14:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to know either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.28,0:14:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.38,0:14:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The point is, you're doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.80,0:14:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.71,0:14:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, bouncing back from a\Ncoma after only a week of rehab?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.58,0:14:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about the power of youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.78,0:14:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that everybody thinks you're\Ndead, what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.10,0:14:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to retire now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.48,0:14:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We heard about what happened at Wrath,\Nabout how they put Rank in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.48,0:14:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't go to the\NRoppongi office anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.52,0:14:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.04,0:14:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still around, just\Nworking in the background.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.00,0:14:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have enough on my plate as it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.02,0:14:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trying to keep the Ocean\NTurtle and the Underworld safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.80,0:14:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are? That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.42,0:14:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So do you know what'll\Nhappen to the Underworld now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.84,0:14:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the moment, things aren't\Nlooking that good for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.26,0:14:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The government still hasn't\Npicked a scapegoat to save face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.48,0:14:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.72,0:14:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've been itching to dismantle\NWrath, and when they do,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.12,0:14:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all our tech will get divvied\Nup by the major conglomerates.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.16,0:14:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll seize Alice,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.86,0:15:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then they'll probably reinitialize\Nthe Light Cube Cluster on the Turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.94,0:15:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.56,0:15:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not going to let\Nthat happen, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.20,0:15:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got a plan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.44,0:15:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.62,0:15:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.84,0:15:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more like a hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.90,0:15:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While the government's running\Naround trying to save their asses,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.16,0:15:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hoping the public\Nwill come to acknowledge
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.70,0:15:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the human rights of the\Nartificial Fluctlights.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.88,0:15:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the way to achieve that is to get\Nas many people from the real world
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as possible to have as much contact\Nwith the Underworld as they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.60,0:15:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like the kind of thing the\NSeed Nexus is for, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.58,0:15:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.68,0:15:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The problem is, the Underworld needs a\Nhigh-bandwidth connection to the Seed Nexus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.78,0:15:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the bigger the bandwidth,\Nthe better the access.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.10,0:15:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, the Underworld's\Ncut off from everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.02,0:15:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The government shut\Ndown the Turtle Satlink.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.18,0:15:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Restoring that connection is\Nnext on my Daddy list, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:15:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That press conference the other\Nday was a step toward that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.70,0:16:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It bought us attention,\Nand even better, time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.26,0:16:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.94,0:16:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chikuoka.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.00,0:16:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, don't let it die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.68,0:16:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.18,0:16:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to beg me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.04,0:16:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, the underworld is the\None dream I'd risk my life for, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.38,0:16:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not gonna work. No\Nway. It's gonna collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.62,0:16:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like always just like the\Ncopies of me and keeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.44,0:16:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did once it finds out\Nit's a copy there's no way
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.66,0:16:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a human soul saved on a\Nlight cube can survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.36,0:16:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of the strain, not even his soul
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.28,0:17:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.88,0:17:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.79,0:17:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it you, Higa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.38,0:17:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah it is so you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't delete me. Instead,\Nyou copied and saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.06,0:17:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.10,0:17:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't delete you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.42,0:17:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the first Fluctlight I've\Never seen that survived 200 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.58,0:17:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.58,0:17:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the longest-living\Nperson in human history. You!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.32,0:17:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hit delete on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.34,0:17:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get why, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.56,0:17:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.42,0:17:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is my Fluctlight the only\None you made a copy of, Higa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.92,0:17:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.83,0:17:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I only had time for yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.00,0:17:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,During the memory delete process,\NKeeks and Rank were doing other things,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.90,0:18:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I went ahead and copied you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.02,0:18:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.84,0:18:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Queen, that is Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.30,0:18:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She and I talked about\Nthe possibility of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.56,0:18:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said that if she were\Nthe only one who got copied,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.64,0:18:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she would have herself deleted right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.68,0:18:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if we both got copied,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.72,0:18:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'd use whatever time we had left to\Nunite the real world and the Underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.72,0:18:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about if only you were copied?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.34,0:18:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you talk about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.40,0:18:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.31,0:18:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We decided if that happened, I'd protect\Nthe Underworld and fight only for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.54,0:18:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it came to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.86,0:18:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.52,0:18:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Underworld's fate is extremely\Nunstable over there, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.52,0:18:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.18,0:18:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Underworld is powerless\Ncompared to the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.92,0:19:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It relies on a power source,\Nhardware, maintenance, and a network.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.76,0:19:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its existence depends on real-world\Npeople to keep the infrastructure running.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.38,0:19:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its safety in the long term\Nis precarious, at best.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.58,0:19:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, but there's\Njust no getting around that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.84,0:19:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Light Cube Cluster?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.14,0:19:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the Underworld, and it\Ncan't be moved off the Ocean Turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.80,0:19:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, the government's got\Ncontrol of the turtle now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.50,0:19:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they wanted to, they\Ncould cut the power tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.34,0:19:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reinitialize the cluster,\Nand wipe it clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long will the reactor's fuel last?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.94,0:19:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I guess,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.70,0:19:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since it's a pressurized\Nwater reactor from a sub,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.92,0:19:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it's just powering the\Ncluster, then four or five years?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.40,0:19:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then there's no need to\Nrefuel during that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as long as we prevent\Noutside interference,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.52,0:19:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The underworld will continue to\Nexist for that length of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.68,0:19:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.38,0:19:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.70,0:19:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no weapons system on the\NTurtle, and without weapons, we can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.26,0:20:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said I would fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.80,0:20:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.40,0:20:06.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way to connect to\Nthe Turtle or the Cluster now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.02,0:20:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The satellite link's been cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.00,0:20:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's another link.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.46,0:20:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We use that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.04,0:20:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What link?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.48,0:20:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Heathcliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.84,0:20:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Akihiko Kayaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.96,0:20:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to find him right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.14,0:20:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will help find him, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.00,0:20:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.91,0:20:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.68,0:20:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kayaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.46,0:20:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A copy of Akihiko Kayaba\Nand Kazuto Kirigaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.80,0:20:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would happen if those copies,\NI mean people, came into contact?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.98,0:20:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.68,0:20:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I might have\Nopened Pandora's box here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.96,0:20:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I want to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.24,0:20:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to know what'll happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.12,0:20:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, you're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.94,0:20:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got some old contacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.60,0:20:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll send a few emails.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.36,0:20:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Encrypted, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.10,0:21:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can take a nap after you finish\Ndoing your sacred arts homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.08,0:21:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you can't copy mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.46,0:21:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I tweaked that skill\Nyou taught me the other day,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.20,0:21:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's go to the training\Nhall so I can show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.94,0:21:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.66,0:21:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You snuck out to buy snacks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.54,0:21:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you got some for me this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.38,0:21:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Kirito. Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.06,0:21:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.64,0:22:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have had all my memories in\Nthat place to lead it. Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.72,0:22:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially the time I spent on YouTube.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.34,0:22:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, tell me about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.34,0:22:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all the fun things and the sad\Nthings, from the beginning to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.78,0:22:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I met him, who's\Nwalking through a forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.38,0:22:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh was chopping at a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.14,0:22:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was a woodcutter in the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.22,0:22:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His job was to cut down this big cedar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.04,0:22:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A tree that, for 300 years,\Ncouldn't be cut down by anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.94,0:23:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.85,0:23:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.24,0:23:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I might die.
